{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35733","headline":"题友生丛竹 · 李咸用","name":"题友生丛竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"菊华寒露浓，兰愁晓霜重。\n指佞不长生，蒲萐今无种。\n安如植丛篁，他年待栖凤。\n大则化龙骑，小可钓璜用。\n留烟伴独醒，回阴冷闲梦。\n何妨积雪凌，但爲清风动。\n乃知子猷心，不与常人共。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35733.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35733","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}